I screwed up the other night trying to rob a shop.  Maybe some of
you will be able to gain some insight from my misfotune:

[Spoilers may or may not follow]













On level 2, my Priest finds a large ring shop.  I tried on all the
uncursed or blessed rings to see if I could identify any.  I put
on one ring:

Manlobbi [or whatever his name was] hits Snoopy
Manlobbi hits Snoopy
Snoopy is killed

OK.  So I've found a ring of conflict, but I have no money.  My dog
is dead so I have no simple way of stealing it.

I continue trying on rings, and find a ring of invisibility.  So now
the shopkeeper is stuck next to the door.  I can now zap him with my 
wand and he won't come after me (a bit of a bug).

Unfortunately, I only have a wand of striking, but I really wanted to
kill the shopkeeper and take the rings.  I decided to try anyways.

I zap him a couple of times, and then the wand dies.  I threw all my
spare weapons at him, and he was still alive.  Great.  Now he's 
mad at me, and I can't take off the rings and leave, because if I take
off the ring of invisiblity he'll kill me.

I take off the ring of conflict, and put on a ring which I thought might
have been teleport (because of the price, and because it was cursed --
I uncursed it with holy water), and waited...and waited... I didn't 
teleport.  At this point a dwarf broke into the shop.  I killed him and
took his pick axe.

Unfortunately, he broke in right next to the shopkeeper, so I couldn't 
go out the way he came in.  But I had a pick axe, so I put the ring 
of conflict back on, and dug a hole in the top of the shop.  I dug 
out three pieces in the wall (so that the Kops could be next to each 
other when I was out of the shop and fight each other not me), and then
I dug a hole out.  The shop then looked like this:

     .     
+---.@.---+  <--- Me
|.........|
|.........|
|.........|
|.@.......|  <--- Shopkeeper
+.|-------+

I then went up the Kops appeared around me.  I started digging down.

The Kop hits the Kop.
The Kop hits the Kop.
You stop digging.  (It stopped me even though they didn't hit me).

Dig again. and again.  and again.  I've dug a pit.

Dig again. and again.  The shopkeeper apears.
Dig again.  The shopkeeper kills the Kops.
Dig again.  The shopkeeper hits me.
Dig again -- The shopkeeper kills me, and takes my stuff.

I know I made a few big mistakes above, and by posting this to the net
I'm opening myself to abuse.  Let me just say that I was playing quickly,
and since I was only on level 2, so I decided to take a few chances. 
